**PureLight™** is an Aerogel technology from Lǜ Sēnlín that transmits 90% of light of glass whilst providing superior insulation (U-value 0.01–0.02 W/(m²·K)). It is lightweight, durable, maximizes photosynthesis by maintaining stable temperatures for year-round crop growth.

